{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)ちゃいてぃーよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の今頃。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/08/26/8039993/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、ここまできましたねーっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"８月も残すとこ僅か！早い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2016も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方各地の皆様には盛りがって貰えたようで良かった！！私も幸せでした。ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、まだまだ神宮三日間がありますからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タオルやうちわやサイリウム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけるからねーっ！！みんな待っててねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと 見えてるからね。本当。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/08/26/8039993/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直 今色々とパンパンです( ºωº)頭も体も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬぁああってなっておる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の要領の悪さに驚くが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが私なのである。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のパターンを知って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受け入れることも大事。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変なのはみんなもだから頑張るの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生さんはお勉強や部活だし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会人さんはお仕事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも趣味や習い事とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々頑張ってるんだもんね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も 負けないようにしなくちゃね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来る限りは尽くそう！頑張れ！楽しめ！と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に言い聞かせて！よしっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噂のピンクのクロックス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/08/26/8266796/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものでも ご褒美にしながら頑張ろう❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコ好きー！甘いアイスも好きー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は牛乳プリンも好きー！ココアも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、買いに行こう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってか その前にてるてる坊主作らなきゃ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/08/26/8039993/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}